# SSSInstagram

> SSSInstagram is a free Instagram downloader that works in the browser with no
> account and nothing to install. Paste a link to a public post, reel, story,
> highlight or profile and the file comes back in the resolution Instagram
> stores: photos as JPG, videos as MP4, carousels slide by slide, all without a
> watermark. Available in 29 languages. No Instagram login is ever requested.
> An Android app is offered separately for people who prefer to download from
> the share menu.

Scope and limits: only public accounts work here — content of private profiles
is not accessible, and that restriction is enforced by Instagram, not bypassed.
Stories can be downloaded while Instagram still serves them, which is 24 hours
after posting; highlights stay until the account owner removes them. Files are
passed through without recompression and without a watermark.

